          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>We were formed on September 30, 2026. In the period from formation to December 31, 2026, we had no revenue and incurred expenses of $10,000. At December 31, 2026, we had cash of $990,000 from an initial equity capital contribution of $1,000,000, no liabilities and no crypto assets.</p><p>In the six months ended June 30, 2027, we sold 35 of the 70 Units of the Startup Offering for $1,750,000. We carried that amount as a contract liability until the Network began to operate on August 31, 2027. In the same period, we incurred cash operating expenses of $1,330,000 and allocated 500,000 AUDT to the MCVs ($500,000, noncash). We reported a net loss of $1,830,000. At June 30, 2027, cash was $1,287,500 and equity was $(340,000). Equity was negative because the deferred Unit revenue is a liability until it is recognized.</p><p>Since June 30, 2027, we have sold the remaining 35 Units for $1,750,000 at closings on July 6 and August 27, 2027. We bought 32 ETH for our Ethereum validator for $128,000. We deployed the Smart Contracts on July 1, 2027, after the Security Audit. In July and August 2027, the Subsidies Contract paid 100,000 AUDT of AUDT Subsidies. The 96,774 AUDT paid to PVNs other than our own is a noncash expense of $96,774; the other 3,226 AUDT were paid to our PVN. By August 31, 2027, the Founding PVNs had been admitted to the Network, and the Network went live on that date. The $3,500,000 from the Units of the Startup Offering is therefore recognized as revenue, with $245,000 of Placement Agent compensation as cost of revenue. Cash at August 31, 2027 was approximately $1,754,000, after the operating expenses of July and August 2027.</p><p>We plan to spend about $1,550,000 in the third quarter of 2027 and $1,750,000 in the fourth quarter, before offering expenses. At that rate, our cash funds our operations for approximately three months without the proceeds of this Offering. The net proceeds of this Offering will be $38,693,750 if all 670 Units are sold. We intend to use the net proceeds as described under \"Intended use of proceeds.\" There is no minimum offering amount.</p><p>We pay Auditchain a royalty of 20 percent of our revenue other than offering proceeds. We will deliver 28,250,000 AUDT to Auditchain after the filing of Form TR (Notes 5 and 6).</p>"
          },
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 221
        },
