          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "No AUDT is minted before the filing of Form TR. Rights to claim AUDT may be awarded at any time, because the Token Contract, the Subsidies Contract and the Claims Contract are deployed. Claims are made through the Claims Contract after the filing of Form TR, and the AUDT of each award is released in equal daily amounts over two years. AUDT claimed before the day named in the Form TR Signal is subject to the lock on transfers of all AUDT until that day. The Claims Contract can mint no more than 30,000,000 AUDT for this allocation."
