          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "No AUDT is minted before the filing of Form TR. After it, the Council Contract mints AUDT from this allocation only in portions that a holder proposes, that pass a Governance Vote with two-thirds of the votes cast and that two-thirds of the Governance Council approves. Each mint names the amount, the purpose and the contract that receives the AUDT. The Council Contract can mint no more than 30,000,000 AUDT for this allocation."
