            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Centralized exchange; account required. This is an intended venue. The Company intends to seek trading of AUDT on this venue three business days after it files Form TR (January 4, 2029 in the timeline of this demonstration). No venue has agreed to list AUDT, and AUDT is not listed on any venue at the date of this document. The Company intends to hold 3,000,000 AUDT and $4,500,000 of USDC from its liquidity allocation in its account on this venue if it lists AUDT. That AUDT is not locked and remains under the Company's control."
