            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Two standard setters, which serve as the initial MCVs and act through the qualified delegates that they name. Other global standard setters that specify data and taxonomy formats may also serve as MCVs."
          },
          "regca:PermissionIdentifierTypedAxis": 2,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 507
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT9593f9ff35-1",
          "@type": "regca:PermissionCapabilitiesDescription",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT9593f9ff35-1",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 387,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasTime": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-09-01",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Admit a PVN to the Network after it passes a Conformance Validation. Perform the annual Conformance Validation: a PVN that does not undergo it forfeits 10 percent of its stake, and a PVN that does not cure its deficiencies within 30 days is deactivated. Confirm that the buyer of a Unit purchased without the Node License qualifies. Test each version of a reporting scheme before it takes effect."
          },
          "regca:PermissionIdentifierTypedAxis": 2,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 508
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTaa06f2a8a5-1",
