            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "The Company alone, until the Handover, on the signatures of two of its three directors. Once Governance Votes open: a Governance Vote together with the ordinary approval of the Governance Council, within the range fixed for each setting."
