          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Name the persons that receive rights to claim AUDT from the team and advisor allocations, within the cap of 30,000,000 AUDT for each. No right may be awarded to the Company, to Auditchain or to any entity that controls, is controlled by or is under common control with either of them. Individuals, including officers and directors of the Company, may receive awards, which the Company discloses. No right may be awarded to a member of the Governance Council or to an affiliate of a member while the member sits, or within one year before or after. AUDT can be claimed only after the filing of Form TR."
