          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Open Governance Votes, AUDT Subsidies above 1,000,000 AUDT, claims and consultation rewards, at a time that is one to seven days after the signal is given, and name the day on which transfers of AUDT open. The Company can withdraw the signal until it takes effect. After that, it cannot be undone or used again."
