          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "File a change to its reporting scheme, without a vote. The change takes effect after a consultation period of 60 days and the scheme tests or, if the developer marks it as an urgent correction, once it has passed the scheme tests. Receive the share of validation fees of a taxonomy developer; Auditchain takes none."
