          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 4,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 818
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT6cbf8df05c-3",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteText",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT6cbf8df05c-3",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 936,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>Expenses of $10,000 consist of corporate formation expenses of $5,000 and $5,000 for the preparation of the Reg CA disclosure. The Company paid both amounts in cash in the period. The Company had no revenue in the period. At December 31, 2026, the Company had no liabilities and no crypto assets, and its cash was $990,000. The Company recognized no income tax benefit for the operating loss (Note 2).</p>"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 4,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 819
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTe39069977b-4",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteNumber",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTe39069977b-4",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 937,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "5",
            "xbrlb:jsonValueKind": "number"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 5,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 820
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTa1a1223ce3-4",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteTitle",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTa1a1223ce3-4",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 938,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "The Auditchain License; related person transactions"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 5,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 821
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTdf8e02521b-4",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteText",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTdf8e02521b-4",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 939,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>On September 30, 2026, the Company entered into the Auditchain License with Auditchain. The Auditchain License is perpetual, global and exclusive. It covers Pacioli and the Disclosure Models, includes future versions and gives the Company the right to sublicense.</p><p>Auditchain is a related person of the Company. The two companies are under common control. Jason Meyers, the Chief Executive Officer, the Chief Financial Officer and a director of the Company, controls both companies and is Lead Architect of Auditchain.</p><p>The Auditchain License became effective on April 5, 2027, at the first closing of the Startup Offering. Its effectiveness was subject to no other condition.</p><p>The consideration for the Auditchain License has two parts. The first is 28,250,000 AUDT, which is 50 percent of the treasury allocation of AUDT and is deliverable to Auditchain after the Company files Form TR. The fair value of that AUDT is $28,250,000 at $1.00 per AUDT, which is the equivalent price per AUDT at which the Company sold Units in the Startup Offering. The second is a royalty of 20 percent of the revenue that the Company derives, in whatever form it is received, excluding the proceeds of the Company's offerings. No cash is payable for the AUDT component.</p><p>Because the parties are under common control, the Company recorded the Auditchain License and the obligation to deliver the AUDT at the carrying amount of the software in the accounts of Auditchain on the effective date (Note 2). That carrying amount is nil. The Company therefore recognizes no asset and no liability. It discloses the obligation to deliver 28,250,000 AUDT after the filing of Form TR as a commitment (Note 6).</p><p>The royalty applies to revenue other than offering proceeds. It also applies to validation rewards that the Company's PVN earns, including rewards paid in AUDT, and to preparation costs that Preparers pay the Company. The Company had no such revenue at the dates of these statements, and no royalty had accrued. The Company recognizes the royalty as an expense as that revenue is earned and pays it in the following period, except that the royalty on AUDT is paid in AUDT after transfers of AUDT open.</p><p>Because the parties are related and under common control, the terms of the Auditchain License are not the result of arm's-length negotiation.</p><p>The Company and Auditchain each operate one validator on Ethereum and intend to operate one validator on Polygon PoS and a full node on Robinhood Chain. Auditchain provides no services to the Company other than the Auditchain License, and the Company makes no payment to Auditchain other than the royalty and the delivery of AUDT described above.</p><p>Related persons hold no AUDT. The Company intends to award rights to claim AUDT from the team and advisor allocations upon the filing of Form TR. The Claims Contract will release the AUDT of each award in equal daily amounts over two years. The rights are for 7,500,000 AUDT for Jason Meyers, 1,500,000 AUDT for Thomas Egan, CPA, and 600,000 AUDT for Avery Lindqvist. The Company recognizes no expense for them until they are awarded.</p>"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 5,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 822
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT4c3c5e7851-5",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteNumber",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT4c3c5e7851-5",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 940,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "6",
            "xbrlb:jsonValueKind": "number"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 6,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 823
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT998854667e-5",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteTitle",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT998854667e-5",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 941,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Commitments"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 6,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 824
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT088ffe1361-5",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteText",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT088ffe1361-5",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 942,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>Under the Auditchain License described in Note 5, the Company is committed to deliver 28,250,000 AUDT to Auditchain after it files Form TR. The fair value of that AUDT is $28,250,000 at the price of $1.00 per AUDT. The Company is also committed to pay Auditchain 20 percent of its revenue, excluding offering proceeds.</p><p>The Company pays Northstar Node Hosting LLC $500 per month for each validator or node that it hosts. That arrangement can be cancelled on 30 days' notice. The Company has no other commitments.</p>"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 6,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 825
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT1bc4fb9d75-6",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteNumber",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT1bc4fb9d75-6",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 943,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "7",
            "xbrlb:jsonValueKind": "number"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 7,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 826
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTa04df9d51a-6",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteTitle",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTa04df9d51a-6",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 944,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Subsequent events"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 7,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 827
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTd92b23178d-6",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteText",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTd92b23178d-6",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 945,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2026-09-30--2026-12-31",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>The Company evaluated subsequent events through March 15, 2027, the date of the report of the independent accountant. For the reissuance of these statements in the offering statement, the Company evaluated subsequent events through September 1, 2027.</p><p>After December 31, 2026, the following events occurred.</p><p>(1) On February 15, 2027, the Company engaged the Placement Agent.</p><p>(2) On April 5, 2027, the Company held the first closing of the Startup Offering. The Auditchain License described in Note 5 became effective at that closing. The Company recognized no asset or liability, because the carrying amount is nil.</p><p>(3) On April 5, 2027, the Company allocated 500,000 AUDT to the two initial MCVs.</p><p>(4) On July 1, 2027, the Company deployed the Smart Contracts, after the Security Audit.</p><p>(5) On August 15, 2027, the Company bought 32 ETH for its Ethereum validator for $128,000.</p><p>(6) On August 27, 2027, the Company completed the Startup Offering of 70 Units. Gross proceeds were $3,500,000 and net proceeds were $3,225,000.</p><p>(7) In July and August 2027, the Subsidies Contract paid 100,000 AUDT of AUDT Subsidies to the PVNs on the Network. The Company recognized the 96,774 AUDT paid to PVNs other than its own as AUDT issued for services of $96,774, which is noncash. The other 3,226 AUDT were paid to the Company's PVN.</p><p>(8) By August 31, 2027, the Founding PVNs had been admitted to the Network, and the Network went live on that date. That event satisfied the performance obligation on all 70 Units. The Company recognized revenue of $3,500,000 and cost of revenue of $245,000 on that date.</p>"
          },
          "regca:FinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 7,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 828
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT16533268e1-0",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteNumber",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT16533268e1-0",
