            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Basis of presentation of the interim financial statements"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 1,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 830
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT60f1943ce3-0",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteText",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT60f1943ce3-0",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 948,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-01-01--2027-06-30",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>These unaudited interim financial statements are as of June 30, 2027 and for the six months ended June 30, 2027. They are condensed. They are prepared in accordance with accounting principles generally accepted in the United States (U.S. GAAP) for interim financial information (ASC 270) and with Rule 8-03(a) of Regulation S-X.</p><p>The interim financial statements apply the accounting policies described in Note 2 to the annual financial statements. Those policies include the recognition of Unit revenue under ASC 606 when a delivered, staked PVN is in an operating Network and the treatment of Placement Agent compensation under ASC 340-40.</p><p>The independent accountant has not audited or reviewed the interim financial statements. In the opinion of management, all adjustments necessary in order to make the interim financial statements not misleading, consisting only of normal recurring adjustments, have been included.</p>"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 1,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 831
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT922a51954b-1",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteNumber",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT922a51954b-1",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 949,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-01-01--2027-06-30",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "2",
            "xbrlb:jsonValueKind": "number"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 2,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 832
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTde3425ac10-1",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteTitle",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTde3425ac10-1",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 950,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-01-01--2027-06-30",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Results of operations and financial position for the period"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 2,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 833
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTb663b6ad03-1",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteText",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTb663b6ad03-1",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 951,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-01-01--2027-06-30",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>During the six months ended June 30, 2027, the Company sold 35 of the 70 Units of the Startup Offering at closings on April 5, May 3 and June 1, 2027 for $1,750,000. The Company presented that amount as a contract liability at June 30, 2027, because the Network had not yet begun operating (Note 2 to the annual financial statements, as applied in these interim financial statements). The Placement Agent compensation of $122,500 on those Units is an asset, presented in other assets. The Company will expense it as cost of revenue when the revenue is recognized. The Company recognized no revenue in the period.</p><p>Operating expenses were $1,830,000. They consist of marketing of $500,000, development of $400,000, legal and policy of $150,000, general and administrative of $250,000, other offering expenses of $30,000 and $500,000 for 500,000 AUDT allocated to the MCVs at $1.00 per AUDT (AUDT issued for services). That amount is noncash and was credited to contributed capital. The net loss was $1,830,000. The Company recognized no tax benefit, because the realization of the loss depended on the recognition of the deferred Unit revenue, which occurred after the period.</p><p>Cash was $1,287,500 at June 30, 2027. That amount reflects the proceeds of the three closings, net of Placement Agent compensation ($1,627,500), less cash operating expenses. Equity was $(340,000) at June 30, 2027, because the deferred Unit revenue is a liability until it is recognized. The deficit reverses on recognition.</p><p>The Auditchain License became effective on April 5, 2027, at the first closing. The Company recognized no asset or liability, because the carrying amount is nil.</p>"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 2,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 834
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTc3a1ac3c98-2",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteNumber",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTc3a1ac3c98-2",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 952,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-01-01--2027-06-30",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "3",
            "xbrlb:jsonValueKind": "number"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 3,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 835
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTeb63b1ae4d-2",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteTitle",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTeb63b1ae4d-2",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 953,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-01-01--2027-06-30",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Subsequent events"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 3,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 836
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTbaf2b6691a-2",
          "@type": "regca:FinancialStatementNoteText",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTbaf2b6691a-2",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 954,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasDatePeriod": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-01-01--2027-06-30",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>The Company evaluated subsequent events through September 1, 2027.</p><p>After June 30, 2027, the following events occurred.</p><p>(1) On July 1, 2027, the Company deployed the Smart Contracts, after the Security Audit.</p><p>(2) On July 6, 2027 and August 27, 2027, the Company sold the remaining 35 Units of the Startup Offering for $1,750,000. Placement Agent compensation on those Units was $122,500.</p><p>(3) On August 15, 2027, the Company bought 32 ETH for its Ethereum validator for $128,000.</p><p>(4) In July and August 2027, the Subsidies Contract paid 100,000 AUDT of AUDT Subsidies to the PVNs on the Network. The Company recognized the 96,774 AUDT paid to PVNs other than its own as AUDT issued for services of $96,774, which is noncash. The other 3,226 AUDT were paid to the Company's PVN.</p><p>(5) By August 31, 2027, the Founding PVNs had been admitted to the Network, and the Network went live on that date. That event satisfied the performance obligation on all 70 Units. On that date, the Company recognized revenue of $3,500,000 and cost of revenue of $245,000, and it released the contract liability of $3,500,000 and the deferred Placement Agent compensation of $245,000.</p>"
          },
          "regca:InterimFinancialStatementNoteIdentifierTypedAxis": 3,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 837
        },
        {
