        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTb7ddd8bab9",
          "@type": "regca:NetworkRewardAllocationGovernanceDescription",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTb7ddd8bab9",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 1277,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasTime": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-09-01",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "<p>Until the Governance Contract is deployed, we set the allocation of rewards: the division of each validation fee shown in this table, the amount of the rewards paid through AUDT Subsidies and the allocation of the proceeds from data subscriptions. We can change it at any time until then. From the deployment of the Governance Contract, the allocation of rewards, including AUDT Subsidies, is subject to governance. We can no longer change it, and no person can change it until Governance Votes open. After that, it can be changed only by a settings proposal that passes a Governance Vote of the holders of AUDT and receives the ordinary approval of the Governance Council, within the range that the Smart Contracts fix for each setting. The allocation in force can be read from the blockchain.</p>"
          },
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 1151
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT6288cf34ab-8",
          "@type": "regca:PermissionRoleName",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT6288cf34ab-8",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 1278,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasTime": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-09-01",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Allocation of rewards"
          },
          "regca:PermissionIdentifierTypedAxis": 9,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 1152
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACT7eeb64d316-8",
          "@type": "regca:PermissionHolderDescription",
          "dct:identifier": "FACT7eeb64d316-8",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 1279,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasTime": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-09-01",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "The Company alone, until the deployment of the Governance Contract, on the signatures of two of its three directors. From that deployment until Governance Votes open: no person. Once Governance Votes open: a Governance Vote together with the ordinary approval of the Governance Council, within the range fixed for each setting."
          },
          "regca:PermissionIdentifierTypedAxis": 9,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 1153
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTcc549fb481-8",
          "@type": "regca:PermissionCapabilitiesDescription",
          "dct:identifier": "FACTcc549fb481-8",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 1280,
          "sbrm-rev:isReportedBy": "regca-1crypto:party/5067001J8OL3RK15TE82/role",
          "cmns-dt:hasTime": "regca-1crypto:period/2027-09-01",
          "sbrm-rst:hasFactValue": {
            "@type": "sbrm-frst:NonNumericFactValue",
            "cmns-txt:hasTextValue": "Change the division of each validation fee among its recipients, which the table of network reward allocation states, the amount of the rewards paid through AUDT Subsidies, which the Subsidies Contract mints, and the allocation of the proceeds from data subscriptions between reporting entities and the PVNs in a cohort."
          },
          "regca:PermissionIdentifierTypedAxis": 9,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 1154
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:fact/FACTfe804cc2ae-8",
